; The rolled modifiers, as text. They used to be a row of four icon-only chips
; whose names lived in tooltip_text - unreachable on a touch build, which left
; the shop unable to answer "what does this actually do" without the compare
; flyout. Three rows because RARITY_MOD_COUNT tops out at 3; _fill_mods shows
; the first modifiers.size() of them and hides Mods entirely for a Common.
;
; Authored at the BODY font, not DisplayLabel: "+9 Lightning Dmg" is the longest
; label Itemizer can build and the display font draws it 414px wide against 262
; here, which would not survive the 808px-wide card the shop and inventory
; panels give. clip_text keeps a future longer label from widening the card.
[node name="Mods" type="VBoxContainer" parent="Card/Content/Layout/TopRow/VBoxContainer" unique_id=555143096]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_constants/separation = 6

